  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialogue
  speachNumber: 0
  speach:
  - It's Friday night, you think about spending another evening at home, acting out
    scenarios with different masks on.
  - 'Your collection has been growing day by day since you started shutting yourself
    indoors and living as a recluse, spending your time painting and modelling masks
    of many shapes and sizes. '
  - 'You place your hand on your favourite mask, the one you have worked on day and
    night for countless hours, your magnum opus. '
  - A flyer slides under your front door. "Mask-n-Date Party". You wanna go! To show
    off your lovely mask!
  who: 01000000010000000100000001000000
